{"title": "Great Weapon Master: All In", "pageid": 3151, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Great_Weapon_Master:_All_In", "categories": ["Bugs", "Passive features", "Toggleable passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Damage.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9c/Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Damage.webp/300px-Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Damage.webp, /w/images/9/9c/Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Damage.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9c/Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Damage.webp/300px-Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Damage.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9c/Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Damage.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Great Weapon Master: All In</b> is a toggleable passive feature provided by the <a href=\"/wiki/Great_Weapon_Master\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Great Weapon Master\">Great Weapon Master</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Feat\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Feat\">Feat</a> that allows <a href=\"/wiki/Two-Handed\" title=\"Two-Handed\">Two-Handed</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Versatile\" title=\"Versatile\">Versatile</a> weapon users to deal extra damage at the cost of reduced accuracy.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When attacking with a melee weapon you are <a href=\"/wiki/Proficient\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Proficient\">Proficient</a> with and are wielding in both hands, <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a> take a -5 penalty, but their damage increases by 10. \n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\"> Details </span></h3>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><img alt=\"Loading Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/6/63/Loading_Icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/63/Loading_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Toggleable</span></dd>\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the feats:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Great_Weapon_Master\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Great Weapon Master\">Great Weapon Master</a>\n</p>\n  <p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Baretha\" title=\"Baretha\">Baretha</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Dead_Whitburn_Servant\" title=\"Dead Whitburn Servant\">Dead Whitburn Servant</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Ebber\" title=\"Ebber\">Ebber</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Fry\" title=\"Fry\">Fry</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Goodge\" title=\"Goodge\">Goodge</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Gyordi\" title=\"Gyordi\">Gyordi</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Lady_Flux\" title=\"Lady Flux\">Lady Flux</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Matthew\" title=\"Matthew\">Matthew</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Preyn\" title=\"Preyn\">Preyn</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Watcher_Guardian\" title=\"Watcher Guardian\">Watcher Guardian</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>This feature applies to any <a href=\"/wiki/Two-Handed\" title=\"Two-Handed\">Two-Handed</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Versatile\" title=\"Versatile\">Versatile</a> melee weapons when off-hand is empty.</li>\n<li>Great Weapon Master: All In <i>does not</i> need to be enabled in order to benefit from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Great_Weapon_Master:_Bonus_Attack\" title=\"Great Weapon Master: Bonus Attack\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Attack_Icon.webp/25px-Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Attack_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8f/Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Attack_Icon.webp/38px-Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Attack_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8f/Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Attack_Icon.webp/50px-Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Attack_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Great Weapon Master: Bonus Attack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Attack_Icon.webp/25px-Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Attack_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8f/Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Attack_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Great_Weapon_Master:_Bonus_Attack\" title=\"Great Weapon Master: Bonus Attack\">Great Weapon Master: Bonus Attack</a>.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>When toggled on, Great Weapon Master reduces <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a> for <a href=\"/wiki/Weapon_action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Weapon action\">weapon actions</a> from <a href=\"/wiki/Two-Handed\" title=\"Two-Handed\">Two-Handed</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Versatile\" title=\"Versatile\">Versatile</a> (no shield) weapons that deal a fixed 1d4 damage. These specific 1d4 weapon actions suffer the accuracy penalty and gain the damage bonus <i>despite</i> the weapon action tooltips not displaying the additional damage.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200003\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.033 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.038 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 758/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 7270/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4601/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 19/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 655/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.005/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 762020/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   31.525      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   31.525      1 -total\n 22.74%    7.169      1 Template:Toggleable\n 21.73%    6.850      1 Template:SmallIcon\n 14.74%    4.648      1 Template:PageSeo\n 13.77%    4.340      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 12.32%    3.883      1 Template:SAI\n 10.29%    3.243      1 Template:Icon_link\n 10.05%    3.167      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n  9.92%    3.126      2 Template:Main_namespace_only\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:3151-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714200003 and revision id 379709. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}